explanations.claude:
The tests pin a specific hidden EOL dataset the spec never gives. A correct fix with a different reasonable mapping fails, for example one that:
- gives Amazon Linux 2 a 2023-06-30 EOL;
- includes Alpine 3.13 or Debian 11;
- omits unreleased Ubuntu 21.04;
- treats extended support as not ended when no extended date exists (FreeBSD 11, Alpine 3.9).
